='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" data-order=\"1\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 30px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 0px 20px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">博望餐饮法务咨询团队<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">专注餐饮领域</strong>，在特许经营备案方面拥有丰富的服务经验。帮助连锁企业合规化发展是团队一直以来努力的方向，<strong>目前团队已协助数十家企业成功完成特许经营备案</strong>，团队同时为连锁企业提供顶层架构搭建、税务筹划咨询、连锁加盟法律文件起草、商业特许经营备案、特许经营法务培训、商业特许经营及商标/著作权、不正当竞争争议解决等法律服务，<strong>并为近百家餐饮连锁企业提供常年法律顾问服务</strong>。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 10px;transform: translate3d(15px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(15px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(15px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(15px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: stretch;flex: 0 0 0%;height: auto;background-color: rgb(166, 9, 9);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 27px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;background-color: rgb(165, 9, 9);box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: stretch;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;background-color: rgb(166, 9, 9);margin: 0px 0px 0px 4px;border-top-right-radius: 20px;border-bottom-right-radius: 20px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: flex;width: 100%;flex-flow: column;b