nslate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" data-order=\"2\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 30px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 0px 20px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p><strong><span style=\"\">商业特许经营</span></strong><span style=\"\">，是指拥有注册商标、企业标志、专利、专有技术等经营资源的企业（以下称特许人），以合同形式将其拥有的经营资源许可其他经营者（以下称被特许人）使用，被特许人按照合同约定在统一的经营模式下开展经营，并向特许人支付特许经营费用的经营活动。</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"\">企业以外的其他单位和个人不得作为特许人从事特许经营活动。</span></strong><span style=\"\"></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 10px;transform: translate3d(15px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(15px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(15px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(15px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: stretch;flex: 0 0 0%;height: auto;background-color: rgb(166, 9, 9);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 27px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;background-color: rgb(165, 9, 9);box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: stretch;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;background-color: rgb(166, 9, 9);margin: 0px 0px 0px 4px;border-top-right-radius: 20px;border-bottom-right-radius: 20px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: flex;width: 100%;flex-flow: column;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"z-index: 5;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);padding: 0px 15px;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.6;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">为什么要商业特许经营备案</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: stretch;flex: 90 90 0%;height: auto;margin: 0px 0px 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 12px 0px 0px;line-height: 0;transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 82%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img wx_img_placeholder_mini __bg_gif\" data-ratio=\"0.008108108108108109\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/Q3nATBhn2vrhuolIohibYLdbkuWQD3A0vMnL21MrvQWGOMV8mEPGjnN7icpDlHJwR2yiaGARooszDOAWqSV7g78iaw/640?wx_fmt=gif#imgIndex=6\" data-w=\"370\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(123.333) / 1; width: 357px !important; height: auto !important;\" width=\"100%\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"9\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" data-order=\"3\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 0px 20px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">1、法律法规：</p><p><strong><span style=\"\">《商业特许经营管理条例》第8条规定：</span></strong><span style=\"\">特许人应当自首次订立特许经营合同之日起15日内，依照《条例》的规定向商务主管部门备案。</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-wrap: wrap;\">《商业特许经营管理条例》</strong>第24条规定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">特许人不具备《条例》规定的条件，从事特许经营活动的，由商务主管部门责令改正，没收违法所得，处10万元以上50万元以下的罚款，并予以公告。</span><span style=\"font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">企业以外的其他单位和个人作为特许人从事特许经营活动的，由商务主管部门责令停止非法经营活动，没收违法所得，并处10万元以上50万元以下的罚款。</span><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-wrap: wrap;\">《商业特许经营管理条例》</strong>第25条规定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">特许人未依照《条例》的规定向商务主管部门备案的，由商务主管部门责令限期备案，处1万元以上5万元以下的罚款；</span><span style=\"font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">逾期仍不备案的，处5万元以上10万元以下的罚款，并予以公告。</span><br></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">2、品牌信用背书：</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">商业特许经营备案后，企业的招商加盟资格将在中国商务部特许经营信息管理系统进行公示，这对在特定区域内稳步成长中的小规模特许人来讲，无疑是强有力的信用背书，<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">使其在品牌形象方面更具有竞争实力。</strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">3、对企业自身权益的保护：</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">在商务部进行了商业特许经营备案后，就只有备案企业有权对外从事特许经营活动，<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">更大程度的加强了对特许人的保护</strong>，包括其知识产权、经营模式、特许经营体系等各方面，<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">也使得特许人对加盟商的约束和管理更加于法有据</strong>。</p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 40px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 30px;vertical-align: top;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;line-height: 0;background-color: rgb(166, 9, 9);align-self: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0%;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img wx_img_placeholder_mini __bg_gif\" data-ratio=\"0.48333333333333334\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/JWNkicfNibFPBxTyibG7ZrQ34VFKQworxQAkCt1yCNCn2qlHibCUzB0PiaJKYTj3YzD04GeGVzqy4GIibV1Bz9poEepQ/640?wx_fmt=gif#imgIndex=7\" data-w=\"300\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(2.06897) / 1; width: 30px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"10\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" data-order=\"4\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 90%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgba(239, 238, 238, 0.5);height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: 15px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);line-height: 2;padding: 0px 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">祝贺博望客户在合规发展方面，又往前迈出了坚实的一步。</strong>博望餐饮法务团队将继续运用专业的法律技能，结合多年的特许经营备案服务经验，持续为众多餐饮企业发展保驾护航！</p></section></section></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"100000292\" data-ratio=\"2.0444444444444443\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72IRu9cDPObrZkMGERkBFBftNPwUyswtS3YjOWL3oTLOx6iajkQL2NeGzDMAYVGjiarhJco9FPQC0ib7w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=8\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 676.984px !important;\" data-original-style=\"\" data-index=\"11\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72IRu9cDPObrZkMGERkBFBftNPwUyswtS3YjOWL3oTLOx6iajkQL2NeGzDMAYVGjiarhJco9FPQC0ib7w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=8\" _width=\"677px\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"2\" data-fail=\"0\"></p></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>",
